---
import OfficialLayout from '../layouts/OfficialLayout.astro'
---

<OfficialLayout title="培训服务" description="珠江国际商事调解院 - 商事调解与谈判技巧培训">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image: url('/images/hero-bg.jpg');" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-950/85 via-rose-900/75 to-gray-900/85" />
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 text-xs text-white/80 mb-4">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"/><path d="M22 10v6"/><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"/></svg>
        <span>Training Services</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white">培训服务</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-rose-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Training Services</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <!-- Overview -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">培训服务概述</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
          <p>
            珠江国际商事调解院致力于培养高素质的商事调解专业人才，提供系统化、国际化的调解培训课程。
            我们的培训体系融合<strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">国际调解标准（如 UNCITRAL 调解规则、ICC 调解规则）</strong>
            与中国的商事调解实践，帮助学员掌握专业的调解技巧与谈判策略。
          </p>
          <p>
            培训对象涵盖<strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">律师、企业法务、仲裁员、企业管理者</strong>以及有志于从事商事调解的各界人士。
            授课师资均为具有丰富实务经验的资深调解员、法律专家和谈判顾问。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Courses -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">培训课程体系</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">商事调解基础课程</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">Fundamentals of Commercial Mediation</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 ml-14">
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">调解基本理论与原则</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">调解员的角色与道德规范</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">调解程序与流程管理</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">沟通技巧与谈判策略</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">跨文化调解实务</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">调解协议起草与执行</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">高级调解员研修课程</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">Advanced Mediator Training</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 ml-14">
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">复杂多方调解技巧</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">心理分析与冲突化解</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">行业特定调解实务（建筑/金融/知产）</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">在线调解技术应用</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">AI 辅助调解工具使用</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">国际调解标准与比较研究</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">企业定制培训</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">Corporate Customized Training</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 ml-14">
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">企业内部争议管理体系建设</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">合同谈判与争议预防</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">法务团队调解能力提升</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">行业专项争议解决训练</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Training Methods -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">培训方式</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">线下授课</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">小班制沉浸式教学，角色扮演、案例研讨、模拟调解等多种互动形式。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">在线直播</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">远程实时授课，突破地域限制，通过在线平台参与互动讨论和案例演练。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">混合模式</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">线上理论学习 + 线下实战演练，兼顾灵活性与实操效果。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Certification -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">认证与证书</h2>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">结业证书</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">完成培训课程并通过考核的学员，将获得珠江国际商事调解院颁发的培训结业证书。</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">调解员资格认证</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">完成高级研修课程并通过评估的学员，可申请纳入本院调解员名册，具备在本院平台接受调解任命的资格。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-rose-600 text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-rose-700 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          咨询培训课程
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</OfficialLayout>
